      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It is the same as this Tracked Canny, except that you found that it also occurs for other pages.\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1236-recent-worldsrecently-updated-worlds-cannot-be-opened-after-opening-recentl\nBased on your information, I also found that I can trigger the same behavior using \"More From This Author\" in the world page (e.g. VRChat Home).\nI think it would be helpful for them to put these examples on Tracked Canny.",
