  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In the launch tab in main menu the categories such as \"Recent Worlds\" etc there is are expand buttons to view more \"+128\" etc...\nPressing these expand buttons has a seemingly random chance to take you to the wrong page. For example: pressing the expand button on \"Recent Worlds\" has a chance of taking you to \"Recently Played With\".\nA particular example that seems to repro fairly consistently is going to the Profile tab and clicking expand on Avatars (my uploaded avatars), then going back to the launch tab and clicking on any of the expand buttons there. This has a very high chance of opening the Avatars list again instead of whatever you clicked on.",
